-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §32 הסדר כולל: no more than 10.5 hours a day
-- of regular work, substitution and school activities; the pay for them is
-- a comprehensive arrangement for all the teacher's work under the reform,
-- save the trips allowance of §40; and nothing here takes away a right by
-- law.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `32 הסדר כולל`

DECLARE `section 32 action` IS ONE OF `employ the teacher beyond 10.5 hours in a day`

-- (א): regular hours (§§15–27), substitution and school activities come to
-- 10.5 hours a day at most.
@ref akn:art_32__para_a
`hours in a working day at most` MEANS 10.5

GIVEN regular IS A NUMBER, substitution IS A NUMBER, activities IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the day is within section 32(א)` regular substitution activities IF
    regular PLUS substitution PLUS activities AT MOST `hours in a working day at most`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `section 32 action`
DECIDE `the daily cap` IS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    SHANT `employ the teacher beyond 10.5 hours in a day`

-- (ב): the pay for those hours is all the pay for the teacher's work under
-- the reform; the one payment outside it is §40's trips allowance.
@ref akn:art_32__para_b
DECLARE `payment for work` IS ONE OF
    `pay for the regular hours`
    `substitution pay`
    `school-activity pay`
    `the trips allowance of section 40`
    `any other payment for work`

GIVEN p IS A `payment for work`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `payable under the reform for work` p IF
    NOT p EQUALS `any other payment for work`

-- (ג): rights by law are untouched; the agreement's rules sit under them.
@ref akn:art_32__para_c
GIVEN `a right by law` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 32 takes it away` `a right by law` IF
    FALSE

#ASSERT `the day is within section 32(א)` 8 1.5 1
#ASSERT NOT `the day is within section 32(א)` 8.5 1 1.5
#ASSERT `payable under the reform for work` `the trips allowance of section 40`
#ASSERT NOT `payable under the reform for work` `any other payment for work`
